{"htmlBody":" \r\n<div style=\"font-size:1px;display:!important\"></div> <div style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0\"><img src=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/open.aspx?ffcb10-fe971075756c077c76-fde7177276620d74761d737c-fe8a1574726d037c7d-fef21377766202-fe1e16787c64057e7c1d78-ff931c74&amp;d&#61;40115\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" /></div> <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"> <div style=\"margin:18px 0\">\r\nTo view this email as a web page, go <a href=\"http://view.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;796aa8e57df5c2eb2dfa867f19c32901260643f31a84bade7da820cec5d46aa56697da3ed1f8bc4ed02e63ce5f329075ded946a5cfd149f1c109d168af03ed6941372339a699452a844347d6f4bb8f52\" rel=\"nofollow\">here.</a></div> </td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" align=\"center\"><tbody><tr><td> <table style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:0px;font-size:16px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;line-height:150%;color:#000000\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"> <table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px\">  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"> <table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100%\"> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:transparent;min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 24px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><img src=\"http://image.e.theaustralian.com.au/lib/fe8a1574726d037c7d/m/1/1fc65725-7a85-48f1-a807-a69cf7fb9508.jpg\" width=\"1\" style=\"padding:0px;text-align:center;height:auto;width:100%\" /></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 0px 16px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;border:0px;min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:32px 0px 0px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded67409c81a62c19832492d1f218f48023a8bda18c49e46df9b5e93214ea008fa432b08901b8b0b88e8662d11d90890f445f817\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n<img src=\"http://image.e.theaustralian.com.au/lib/fe8a1574726d037c7d/m/3/c908ba66-c2f1-412e-9de9-9cc2fe8d3d63.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"89\" width=\"413\" style=\"padding:0px;text-align:center;height:89px;width:413px;border:0px\" /></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 0px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:transparent;min-width:100%;border-top:1px solid #dddddd;border-right:0px;border-bottom:0px;border-left:0px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"http://image.e.theaustralian.com.au/lib/fe8a1574726d037c7d/m/1/950eb40f-660a-46f4-91ac-f905c49172fc.png\" height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"padding:0px;text-align:center;height:1px;width:1px\" /></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>  </td></tr></tbody></table> </td></tr></tbody></table> </td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"> <table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:33%\"> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:transparent;min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 0px 0px 24px\"></td></tr></tbody></table>  </td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:67%\"> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:transparent;min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 24px 0px 0px\"></td></tr></tbody></table>  </td></tr></tbody></table> </td></tr></tbody></table> </td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\"><div>\r\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"top\"> <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:100%\"> <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:transparent;min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px 24px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><b>The truth is out there.</b><br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrime Minister Scott Morrison will today announce a <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674096bb1215067733e8c45999939a144c001702a5603d64cd5f6addf74b1ddf63aed2d85c8a0aba71aba43036e1ac7030d13\" style=\"color:#277f9c;text-decoration:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\">$1.3b Modern Manufacturing Initiative</a> to fund six local manufacturing sectors — resources and minerals; goods and beverages; medicine; clean energy; defence and space. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nShowing shades of Kevin Rudd’s “I never want to be prime minister of a country that doesn&#39;t make things any more” ... Morrison is expected to tell the National Press Club: “We make things in Australia. We do it well. We need to keep making things in Australia.”<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExcept for cars. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nBHP wants a <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674097b22d30e945576f0d2812f745fe10161d585d4d60a005ea526cb54861d064bb52ffb9ae74a469848b2d374b4b1c4c2a3\" style=\"color:#277f9c;text-decoration:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\">big business led economic recovery</a>. CEO Mike Henry is announcing his own $800m package today to fund 3,500 new apprentices and trainees, saying BHP must take a leading role in “helping Australia’s recovery”. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeputy Prime Minister Michael McCormack is playing matchmaker. He’s suggested unemployed youth could <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674095eb49c7239d852505ed7db8b01291dbdb43b1522d47078facead11ae1269fd417d455b6e6ca9b382a9390812ca835ae7\" style=\"color:#277f9c;text-decoration:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\">find love fruit picking</a>, as well as snapping some much needed photos for the ’gram.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn update on the COVID-19 Relief and Recovery Fund. North Queensland tourism operators will be paid for Great Barrier Reef conservation work and heritage sites will be upgraded around the nation as <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674099bd1bac6ac56eaaadf62a9320951be864900cf1d1f15574163b710ef39830c6117db8dc66ca51b0e9d4662ff3fa560eb\" style=\"color:#277f9c;text-decoration:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\">part of a $61.7m program</a>.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe government’s plans to change higher education funding have been dealt a blow — <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740963d6cee11923837d4ec84d9c490adccbac35506c218ea51f187f3f806f9b76ead93ce828067b80b8e965699aa9c760c4\" style=\"color:#277f9c;text-decoration:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jacqui Lambie won’t be voting for them</a>. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Weird and obscure culture wars where universities are the enemy and the working class are collateral damage,” is how the key crossbencher described the bill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd Josh Frydenberg’s <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740956549b8aa1121339a4b4fe2f68f61ca55c32e4f493b2333d842b047d600768f452aedb75bf87a0e55c7d1ff099b2a714\" style=\"color:#277f9c;text-decoration:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\">worst fiscal fears might come true</a>. Victoria could have its credit rating slashed within weeks and other states are at growing risk of following suit. </td></tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:10%;padding-right:3px\">\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><img src=\"http://image.e.theaustralian.com.au/lib/fe8a1574726d037c7d/m/3/87bc3815-13ab-4788-96ff-158afa88f0ae.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"60\" width=\"60\" style=\"padding:16px 0px 0px;text-align:left;height:60px;width:60px;border:0px\" /></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90%;padding-left:3px\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:16px 0px 0px\">\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:transparent;min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">ALICE WORKMAN</span></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:75%;width:93%\"><div style=\"border-color:#dadada;line-height:1px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid\"> </div></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px\"><tbody><tr><td>\r\n      \r\n      <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;width:550px\" width=\"550\" align=\"center\">\r\n            \r\n               \r\n                  \r\n                        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td>\r\n\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"12\"></td></tr></tbody></table><a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674090a980bb9d75926cae4f2ac7659696c3cbdff7673330ac9ad81c65a20a40eac5c56d16f6deee245a9029ef8fd142b52bd\" style=\"border:0;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.newsapi.com.au/image/v1/b636139c10073eab3844b68479f928e9?width&#61;768\" style=\"border:0;max-width:100%\" alt=\"\" /></a><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"12\"></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:30px;color:#000000;text-align:left\"><a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674090a980bb9d75926cae4f2ac7659696c3cbdff7673330ac9ad81c65a20a40eac5c56d16f6deee245a9029ef8fd142b52bd\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">$1.5BN BUDGET PLEDGE</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:34px;color:#000000;text-align:left\"><a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674090a980bb9d75926cae4f2ac7659696c3cbdff7673330ac9ad81c65a20a40eac5c56d16f6deee245a9029ef8fd142b52bd\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n Make or break: PM’s national rebuild\r\n</a></div><div style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:22px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-weight:400;text-align:left\"><a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674090a980bb9d75926cae4f2ac7659696c3cbdff7673330ac9ad81c65a20a40eac5c56d16f6deee245a9029ef8fd142b52bd\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nScott Morrison will announce a $1.3bn Modern Manufacturing Initiative to leverage co-investment across six priority areas.\r\n\r\n\r\n</a></div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:22px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-weight:400;text-align:left\"><a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded674090a980bb9d75926cae4f2ac7659696c3cbdff7673330ac9ad81c65a20a40eac5c56d16f6deee245a9029ef8fd142b52bd\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nBy GEOFF CHAMBERS, JOE KELLY\r\n</a></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"12\"></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:75%\"><div style=\"border-color:#dadada;line-height:1px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid\"> </div></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"12\"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n                    \r\n                        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"16\"></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\">\r\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:0;padding-right:20px;max-width:300px;min-height:130px\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740963aa63da46017203b2c8d9f8cfd9dd4f575e084bffc91173158fa97946514c5b225c70a223a9863d40d6b5535865e77c\" style=\"border:0;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.newsapi.com.au/image/v1/3923da060378f53e23893332bcb40749\" style=\"border:0;max-width:100%;width:300px\" /></a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:100%;color:#000000;text-align:left\"> <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740963aa63da46017203b2c8d9f8cfd9dd4f575e084bffc91173158fa97946514c5b225c70a223a9863d40d6b5535865e77c\" style=\"border:0;color:#ed5843;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">EXCLUSIVE</a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#000000;text-align:left;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:10px\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740963aa63da46017203b2c8d9f8cfd9dd4f575e084bffc91173158fa97946514c5b225c70a223a9863d40d6b5535865e77c\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">BHP urges big business-led rally</a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-weight:400;padding-bottom:16px;text-align:left\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740963aa63da46017203b2c8d9f8cfd9dd4f575e084bffc91173158fa97946514c5b225c70a223a9863d40d6b5535865e77c\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mike Henry has called for big business to lead Australia’s post-pandemic economic recovery.\r\n\r\n</a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-weight:400;text-align:left\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded6740963aa63da46017203b2c8d9f8cfd9dd4f575e084bffc91173158fa97946514c5b225c70a223a9863d40d6b5535865e77c\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">By GEOFF CHAMBERS\r\n   </a></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:75%\"><div style=\"border-color:#dadada;line-height:1px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px\"> </div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n                    \r\n                        <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td height=\"16\"></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\">\r\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:0;padding-right:20px;max-width:300px;min-height:130px\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded67409a92a1c2ec88d4a3e0099b38e5914cd4d1021544914cf2418a2fa01b73d1bf91ac4d4067e2d12dc851e2bd014f34a8ac8\" style=\"border:0;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.newsapi.com.au/image/v1/e664355b30890f168f21d4463b2d1f96\" style=\"border:0;max-width:100%;width:300px\" /></a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;line-height:100%;color:#000000;text-align:left\"> <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded67409a92a1c2ec88d4a3e0099b38e5914cd4d1021544914cf2418a2fa01b73d1bf91ac4d4067e2d12dc851e2bd014f34a8ac8\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">BUDGET 2020</a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#000000;text-align:left;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:10px\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded67409a92a1c2ec88d4a3e0099b38e5914cd4d1021544914cf2418a2fa01b73d1bf91ac4d4067e2d12dc851e2bd014f34a8ac8\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">‘Show us the money to save the arts’</a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-weight:400;padding-bottom:16px;text-align:left\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded67409a92a1c2ec88d4a3e0099b38e5914cd4d1021544914cf2418a2fa01b73d1bf91ac4d4067e2d12dc851e2bd014f34a8ac8\" style=\"border:0;color:#000000;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">In the lead-up to Budget we’re meeting one extended family-and-friends group profoundly affected by COVID-19 to hear what they’re seeking from Treasurer Josh Frydenberg. Today acclaimed costume designer Harriet Oxley says the government must urgently kick its proposed arts rescue package into gear. \r\n\r\n</a>\r\n   </div>\r\n   <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39; , &#39;times&#39; , serif;font-weight:400;text-align:left\">\r\n    <a href=\"http://click.e.theaustralian.com.au/?qs&#61;5952deb5ded67409a92a1c2ec88d4a3e0099b38e5914